PenguID: face unlock for Omarchy, as a lock screen plugin and a polkit dialog plugin.
Copyright (C) 2026 ReidenXerx. Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE.

The polkit dialog (reidenxerx.penguid-polkit, in polkit/) is a clone of Omarchy's polkit agent plugin
(shell/plugins/polkit, Omarchy 4.0.3), under the same MIT License. PenguID added its face lane: the Enter
prompt handling, the PenguID mark and PAM's notes under the card.

This plugin is a clone of Omarchy's lock screen plugin (shell/plugins/lock, Omarchy 4.0.3),
Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson, released under the MIT License (reproduced below).

The face lane (activation on fresh input, three tries per activation, lid handling, the
omarchy-lock-face PAM service and the face indicator) comes from Omarchy pull request #6863,
"Add smooth face unlock UX to Omarchy" by @mateuszkowalczyk:
https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/pull/6863

Face authentication is performed by irlume (GPL-3.0-or-later): https://github.com/archledger/irlume

